Description:

The accountId and fromAccountId arguments of a JMAP request are now required
to hold only the characters Cyrus permits in an account identifier, and to be
of bounded length.  Previously either was accepted as any string at all,
including one holding path separators, and the value was then used to build
paths on the server.

Tracked as GitHub security advisory GHSA-32q2-7mp9-4vrh.


